tone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;c:if test=&quot;${sLevel == 0}&quot;&gt; 관리자 메뉴 &lt;/c:if&gt;        &lt;!-- else 없음 --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;c:choose&gt;\r\n  &lt;c:when test=&quot;${point &gt;= 90}&quot;&gt; A &lt;/c:when&gt;          &lt;!-- if --&gt;\r\n  &lt;c:when test=&quot;${point &gt;= 80}&quot;&gt; B &lt;/c:when&gt;          &lt;!-- else if --&gt;\r\n  &lt;c:otherwise&gt; C &lt;/c:otherwise&gt;                      &lt;!-- else --&gt;\r\n&lt;/c:choose&gt;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">test 안은 EL 식. 비교 연산자는 EL 페이지 참고 (gt, lt, eq …)</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Python › match, Java › switch</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl/condition","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"jstl","title":"JSTL","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl"}],"hasImage":false}